T* (\\title{Macroeconomic Growth, Structural Transformation, and Development Strategy for Bihar: \\\\) Tj
T* (A Theory-Consistent, Empirically Anchored Research Agenda}) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (\\author{Applicant Name}) Tj
