T* (\\end{equation}) Tj
T* (using system-GMM and bias-corrected fixed-effects estimators. The goal is not universal) Tj
T* (coefficients, but disciplined priors for Bihar-specific calibration.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (\\subsection{Indian state panel evidence}) Tj
T* (An Indian-state panel allows richer comparability by controlling for federal institutions and) Tj
