T* (local multiplier effects.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (In Bihar, land fragmentation, uneven irrigation access, variable extension quality, and) Tj
T* (climate shocks jointly lower expected returns to private farm investment. Under these) Tj
T* (conditions, farmers rationally choose lower-risk but lower-productivity practices. The macro) Tj
T* (consequence is a persistent gap between potential and realized agricultural value added.) Tj
T* (Closing that gap requires a package: resilient water control systems, decentralized extension) Tj
T* (with agronomic analytics, climate-indexed risk instruments, and value-chain integration) Tj
T* (through storage, grading, and rural logistics.) Tj
T* () Tj
