T* (inefficiency dominates and where structural constraints are binding. Policy relevance is) Tj
T* (immediate: if the dominant issue is technical inefficiency, extension and input quality) Tj
T* (reforms should lead; if structural constraints dominate, public goods investment should be) Tj
T* (front-loaded.) Tj
T* () Tj
